 "_note": "Labelled cases for the benchmark. Photographs are fetched from their published source at run time and checked against the sha256 recorded here, so no third-party photo is redistributed with this repository. provenance: 'real' = an unmodified photograph of a real device, 'real-crop' = a crop of one (the same evidence framed differently, not an independent case), 'synthetic' = a variant generated locally from a genuine photo. Add a case by appending an entry with url+sha256; set synthetic_ok on a genuine case to have a synthetic tampered variant derived from it.",
